<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#F5F7F2', padding: '60px', fontFamily: '"Source Han Sans SC", "Microsoft YaHei", Arial, sans-serif', position: 'relative' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0A120E' }}>权限挂在对象上，不挂在人身上</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#66756D', marginTop: 10 }}>方案 · 权限</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#DDE4DC', marginTop: 14 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 40, marginTop: 26, height: 486 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 430, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#66756D', letterSpacing: 2 }}>五个档位，按对象授予</Text>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 12, gap: 6 }}>
                {[
                    { p: '查看者', d: '可见、可在线预览', w: 300 },
                    { p: '贡献者', d: '+ 下载、打印、上传', w: 330 },
                    { p: '编辑者', d: '+ 在线编辑、复制、改名', w: 360 },
                    { p: '管理者', d: '+ 移动、删除、内部分享', w: 390 },
                    { p: '所有者', d: '全部能力，并且可以授权', w: 420 },
                ].map((it, i) => (
                    <Box key={i} style={{ width: it.w, background: i === 4 ? '#0F5C40' : '#EEF1EA', borderRadius: 8, padding: '8px 12px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: i === 4 ? '#FFFFFF' : '#0A120E' }}>{it.p}</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: i === 4 ? '#DDE4DC' : '#66756D' }}>{it.d}</Text>
                    </Box>
                ))}
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#66756D', marginTop: 12, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                档位只是常用组合，底层是 <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F5C40' }}>15 个原子权限位</span>，"能看不能下载"可以直接表达。
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#66756D', letterSpacing: 2 }}>每次请求都走同一条判定链</Text>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 12 }}>
                {[
                    { n: '1', t: '租户', d: '主体与对象同租户' },
                    { n: '2', t: '会话', d: '账号有效、未被吊销' },
                    { n: '3', t: '对象', d: '存在且未删除' },
                    { n: '4', t: '密级', d: '用户密级 ≥ 对象密级' },
                    { n: '5', t: '显式拒绝', d: '任何一条 deny 命中即拒' },
                    { n: '6', t: '允许集合', d: '就近的显式授权生效' },
                    { n: '7', t: '条件', d: '网段、MFA、配额等' },
                ].map((s, i) => (
                    <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16, padding: '10px 0', borderBottom: i < 6 ? '1px solid #EDF1F6' : 'none' }}>
                        <Box style={{ width: 24, height: 24, borderRadius: 12, background: i === 3 ? '#C6EE4B' : '#66756D', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>{s.n}</Text>
                        </Box>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0A120E', width: 110 }}>{s.t}</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#66756D' }}>{s.d}</Text>
                    </Box>
                ))}
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ marginTop: 16, background: '#EEF1EA', borderLeft: '3px solid #C6EE4B', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 18px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0A120E', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    任何一步拿不到依据就<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>直接拒绝</span>——不存在"读不到权限就先放行"。
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 60, right: 60, top: 676, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#A9B5AE' }}>NeuroDMS · 产品概览</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#A9B5AE' }}>05</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
